+/**
+ * Draw normalised path points (fractions of w/h) as a custom-geometry shape.
+ * A point is [x, y] for a line, [x, y, 'm'] to start a subpath,
+ * [x, y, x1, y1, x2, y2] for a cubic bezier, and 'z' to close.
